invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma.c
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: normalize_digits drops the carry that lane 7 of each register
  generates into lane 0 of the register above in its pass of single-bit
  carries, so a lane above 2^52 - 1 at a register's top loses its carry.
  After the first pass of carries a random product leaves a lane at 2^52
  or above with odds below 2^-40, so bin/rsa_ifma_model_test's run of
  normalize_digits on lanes at and around 2^52 is what sees the number
  change.

--- old
        unsigned shifted = ((generate << 1) | generate_from_below) & 0xffU;
--- new
        unsigned shifted = ((generate << 1) | (generate_from_below & 0)) & 0xffU;
